title: "Mortality Table Builder: an end-to-end actuarial mortality pipeline for Mexico"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vilchis
    given-names: Miguel
repository-code: "https://github.com/deadmigue55/Mortality-Table-Builder"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - actuarial science
  - mortality
  - life tables
  - Mexico
  - reinsurance
  - longevity
abstract: >-
  Mexico's mortality tables rebuilt from INEGI registered deaths and CONAPO population,
  graduated, projected and used for experience studies, pricing, reserving, stress testing and
  reinsurance, with a dashboard, an Excel workbook and a methodology report.
